"content": "If I had planned it,", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "you would still be guessing if I arranged it or not.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "I wouldn't have been able to take time off.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "terrible today, for sure. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 0}], "id": 2}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "If you hadn't become a bar manager,", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "terrible today, for sure.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "you arranged the whole thing.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "you would be a detective. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 1}], "id": 3}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "If you hadn't arranged the whole thing", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "you would still be guessing if I arranged it or not.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "I wouldn't have been able to take time off.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "you arranged the whole thing.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 0}], "id": 4}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "rec"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 5}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Vanessa and Amy talk about what would've happened if things had been done differently.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\"> Read the sentence. </span> <span class=\"bullet\"> Select the correct answer to complete the sentence.  </span> <span class=\"bullet\">  Record yourself saying the sentences aloud. </span>\n<span class=\"bullet\"> Check your pronunciation with your instructor. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DMC", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le13ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Another good session. Do you have some time to chat?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: We can chat for a while until my next client arrives.  She goes to the coffee shop before she comes in, so we have time. She will come in for our session after she drinks her latte. It's her system.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm going straight to the restaurant after I leave. That's my system.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Well. You look light as a feather. Anything new?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter took me to see the Foo Fighters.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Really? Good time?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  It was something else. Originally, I didn't want to do anything for the entire day. I just wanted to stay home and veg, but if I hadn't gone, I would feel terrible today, for sure. If I hadn't gone, I would feel really depressed.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Absolutely. Do you feel depressed now?<br/>", "id": 1, "time": "50", "image": "engenn10le13ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No! I feel great.  If I hadn't gone, I wouldn't have met Dave Grohl in person. I hadn't really met anyone famous before.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Backstage passes. Very cool!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Finally, if I hadn't gone, I wouldn't know you arranged the whole thing.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: How did you know? Did Peter tell you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Nope. I saw your name scribbled on the envelope.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Wha ... I told him ... <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You'll get used to it. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>:  If I had planned it, you would still be guessing if I arranged it or not.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It was a lovely gesture. Peter and I had a good talk.  We had a heart to heart. We cried on each others shoulders. It was good.  You must have friends in high places?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: I have a few friendly connections.", "id": 2, "time": "54000", "image": "engenn10le13ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So? How long have you and Peter been dating?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: A couple of weeks now.  We had dated once before, and Peter and I ran into each other again when you and I were talking about life coaching that night at the bistro.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I would have never known that if you hadn't told me just now.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Somehow I doubt that. If you hadn't become a bar manager, you would be a detective. Anyway, we are taking it slow while we get to know each other.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's my Peter.  Always taking his time.", "id": 3, "time": "105900", "image": "engenn10le13ob10re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le13ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le13ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "What Happened Last Night?", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Shoulder to Cry On", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Unreal Past: Past Results of a Present Condition", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can talk about two different times in a <span class=\"strong\">mixed conditional</span> sentence. In this type of <span class=\"strong\">mixed conditional</span>, you can talk about a present condition with a result in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In this conditional, you are talking about <span class=\"underline\">a past time in the main clause and something that always happens or is happening now in the if-clause</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If</span> I <span class=\"strong\">didn't have</span> children, I <span class=\"strong\">would have</span> saved more money.</span><br/> The reality is that I have children (present condition), and I didn't save more money (past result before now).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">would have traveled</span> more often <span class=\"strong\">if</span> I <span class=\"strong\">had</span> more money.</span><br/> The reality is that I didn't travel often (past result before now), and I don't have money (present condition).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Grammar Structure:</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If</span> + simple past , <span class=\"strong\">would have</span> + past participle<br/> <span class=\"strong\">would have</span> + past participle...<span class=\"strong\">if</span> + simple past</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Remember that you are talking about unreal situations, so the information in this conditional is opposite to the true situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Pronunciation Note</span>: In speaking, <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">would have</span></span> is usually joined and sounds more like <span class=\"italic\">/woulduv/</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">If I hadn't gone</span>, I <span class=\"strong\">would feel </span>terrible today, for sure. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">If I hadn't gone</span>, I <span class=\"strong\">would feel</span> really depressed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Finally, <span class=\"strong\">if I hadn't gone</span>, I <span class=\"strong\">wouldn't know </span>you arranged the whole thing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">If I had planned</span> it, you <span class=\"strong\">would still be guessing</span> if I arranged it or not.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Somehow I doubt that.<span class=\"strong\"> If you hadn't become</span> a bar manager, you <span class=\"strong\">would be</span> a detective.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Time Clauses: Talking about the Present and Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can talk about things in the present and future by using time clauses in your sentences.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Both clauses use the Present Simple tense. This is similar to the zero conditional and talks about situations that are generally true.<br/> Example:<br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">When</span> it is sunny, I go to the beach.<br/> I stay home <span class=\\\"strong\\\">when</span> I feel sick.</span><br/><br/>   \u272d\u272d Don't forget to use commas if the time clause comes before the main clause.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You can talk about things in the future using time clauses as well; however, <span class=\\\"underline\\\">the verb tense in the time clause is in the present</span>.<br/><br/>  This is sometimes confusing, since many students want to use a future verb form in the time clause.<br/><br/>  You can use <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">when, after, before, as soon as</span></span>.<br/><br/>  When you talk about specific events where the event in the main clause depends on the completion of the action in the time clause, then use the present perfect in the time clause.<br/> Example:<br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">As soon as </span>you'<span class=\\\"underline\\\">ve finished</span> your dessert, we'll get the bill and leave. </span><br/> (The time clause action \u201cfinishing dessert\u201d has to be finished in order for the main clause event \u201cgetting the bill and leaving\u201d to happen.)<br/><br/>   For more general situations, you can use the present simple in both clauses.<br/> Example:<br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">After</span> having a meal, people usually have dessert.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "We can chat for a while <span class=\"strong\">until</span> my next client arrives.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She goes to the coffee shop <span class=\"strong\">before</span> she comes in, so we have time. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She will come in for our session <span class=\"strong\">after</span> she drinks her latte.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm going straight to the restaurant <span class=\"strong\">after</span> I leave. That's my system.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Peter and I ran into each other again <span class=\"strong\">when</span> you and I were talking about life coaching.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "light as a feather ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that does not weigh a lot", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You look light as a feather. Anything new?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear when you reveal a secret.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "something else", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an exceptional person or thing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was something else.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to veg", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be totally relaxed without stress or worry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I just wanted to stay home and veg.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "envelope", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a \u200bflat, usually \u200bsquare or \u200brectangular, \u200bpaper \u200bcontainer for a \u200bletter", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I saw your name scribbled down on the envelope.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gesture", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an \u200baction that \u200bexpresses \u200byour \u200bfeelings or \u200bintentions, \u200balthough it might have little \u200bpractical \u200beffect", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was a lovely gesture. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "heart-to-heart", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a conversation that is candid, intimate, and personal", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We had a heart-to-heart.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "friends in high places", "type": "name"}, {"content": "people in senior positions who are able and willing to use their influence on one's behalf", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You must have friends in high places?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Watch the TED Talk by Frank Warren, \"Half a Million Secrets\".", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take notes while you watch the video. Watch as many times as you need to. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look up any words you don't know.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph that summarizes the information in the video. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Next, write a secret to share.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your paragraph with a partner and ask for feedback.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I watch a TED Talk.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take notes while watching a video.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I summarize my notes in a paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share secrets with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}